Application LIVE
I have a working application on my local system.
I push the source code to GitHub.
Jenkins is integrated with GitHub and automatically triggers a CI/CD pipeline whenever there is a code change.
Jenkins pulls the latest code, builds a Docker image, runs the container, and deploys the application on a port.
The application becomes live without any manual intervention.


